  "description": "Blackthorn C 145 Eagle 90 Transmission is a carbon fiber all-mountain bike built for wide-ranging adventures. The efficient carbon frame is loaded with cargo features (including room for two bottles) so you can spend less time worrying about resupply on longer day rides or bikepacking trips. Balanced geometry makes for efficient climbing and confident descending, and Blackthorn’s Split Pivot suspension design optimizes pedaling and braking performance to match. 145mm rear and 160mm front travel from the FOX suspension keeps you in control through the most challenging trail segments.\n\nTopping it all off is SRAM’s Eagle 90 group, which delivers reliable mechanical shifting and a wide gear range so you can always find your cadence whether grinding up climbs or pedaling flat-out.",
